Package: claude-usage-widget
Version: 0.2.25
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Stepan Zrnik
Depends: libc6, systemd, plasma-workspace, curl, unzip, python3
Description: KDE Plasma widget for Claude, Codex, Toggl and JIRA usage
 A native KDE Plasma widget backed by a local daemon. It shows Claude and
 Codex rate limits, Toggl earnings progress, and JIRA sprint/ranking status.
